# What a Docker build may see (compose.yaml builds both images from the
# repository's root). Nothing but the code: no settings, no uploads, no
# database copy - an image can be handed to anyone.
*

!client
!server/package.json
!server/package-lock.json
!server/src
!server/assets
!server/scripts

**/node_modules
**/.env
**/*.env
client/dist
client/.angular
client/coverage
client/design
server/scripts/input
